      "releases": [
        {
          "name": "@tangleai/os",
          "type": "minor"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Applications have right-click menus the desktop draws: a default menu for a window (`setContextMenu` and `onContextMenu`) and a menu for one target (`menu(items, at)`, answering the chosen id or null), for shipped modules and framed pages alike. Items are text and desktop glyphs with separators, disabled and checked items, a shortcut hint and one level of submenus; a document that does not match `MENU_SCHEMA` is refused with `OS0170`.",
      "id": "app-menus"
    }
  ],
